<b>HelixToolkit.SharpDX.Core.csproj</b>
Framework: netstandard2.0
Renderer: DirectX11
Defines: NETFX_CORE, CORE, SHARPDX, DX11, MSAA, DX11_1
end note

note bottom of winui2
<b>HelixToolkit.WinUI.csproj</b>
Framework: net6.0-windows10.0.19041
Platform: WinUI 3 legacy
Defines: WINUI, DX11_1
end note

note bottom of sharpdx_core_wpf2
<b>HelixToolkit.SharpDX.Core.Wpf.csproj</b>
Framework: netcoreapp3.1
Platform: discontinued legacy WPF wrapper
Defines: DX11, DX11_1, MSAA, SHARPDX, COREWPF
end note

' =====================================================================
' Defines Legend
' =====================================================================
note as define_legend
  <b>Define Constants Legend</b> (non-default, excl. TRACE/DEBUG)

  <b>Platform/SDK:</b>
    NETFX_CORE     - .NET Native / UWP runtime
    WINDOWS_UWP    - Legacy Universal Windows Platform (not actively built)
    WINUI          - Legacy Windows UI Library path
    CORE           - DirectX core compatibility library

  <b>Graphics:</b>
    SHARPDX        - Legacy compatibility name, Silk.NET backend
    DX11           - DirectX 11
    DX11_1         - DirectX 11.1
    MSAA           - Multi-sample Anti-Aliasing

  <b>Integration:</b>
    COREWPF        - Legacy Core WPF binding
    ASSIMP         - Assimp model loader (separate pkg)
end note

@enduml
